{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"694fd58b-bd61-4f7b-a98d-9856a0ed3fa8","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":683215,"messageId":683215,"newsId":635790,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - third tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the third tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 22 July 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 23 July to no later than 26 October 2026.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 22 July 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/678529\n\nFrom 21 September to 25 September 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n701,262 own shares at an average price of NOK 405.9719 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Date             |Trading    |              |       Daily|                    |\n|                 |venue      |    Aggregated|    weighted|                    |\n|                 |           |  daily volume|     average|         Total daily|\n|                 |           |    (number of| share price|   transaction value|\n|                 |           |       shares)|       (NOK)|               (NOK)|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|21 September     |OSE        |       136,000|    412.1174|       56,047,966.40|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+----------