TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|25 September     |OSE        |       141,000|    405.2090|       57,134,469.00|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total for the    |OSE        |              |            |                    |\n|period           |           |       701,262|    405.9719|      284,692,637.21|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Previously       |OSE        |     5,567,791|    393.3827|    2,190,272,928.71|\n|disclosed buy-   +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|backs under the  |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|tranche          +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     5,567,791|    393.3827|    2,190,272,928.71|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total buy-backs  |OSE        |     6,269,053|    394.7910|    2,474,965,565.91|\n|under the tranche+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|(accumulated)    |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     6,269,053|    394.7910|    2,474,965,565.91|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n20,903,788 own shares, corresponding to 0.87% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 9,804,028 own shares,\ncorresponding to 0.41% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: A overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n\nInvestor relations\nBård Glad Pedersen, senior vice president Investor Relations,\n+47 918 01 791\n\nMedia\nSissel Rinde, vice president Media Relations,\n+47 412 60 584\n","category":[{"id":1007,"category_no":"UTSTEDERS MELDEPLIKT VED HANDEL I EGNE AKSJER","category_en":"ACQUISITION OR DISPOSAL OF AN ISSUER'S OWN SHARES"}],"markets":["XOSL"],"issuerId":1309,"correctionForMessageId":0,"correctedByMessageId":0,"issuerSign":"EQNR","issuerName":"Equinor ASA","instrId":0,"instrumentName":"","instrumentFullName":"","publishedTime":"2026-09-29T06:00:16.198Z","test":false,"numbAttachments":1,"attachments":[{"id":333961,"name":"Detailed overview of transactions.pdf"}],"clientAnnouncementId":"7f3f158c-26a4-44c4-a143-76f4cea9e61f","infoRequired":1,"oamMandatory":1}}}